The n8n workflow for this template lands here as `workflow.json` when the
video publishes. (Maintainer: delete this file when adding the export.)

Sanitization checklist before committing any export:
1. Export from n8n WITHOUT credentials (use the export option).
2. Confirm the JSON contains NO: API keys, tokens, real phone numbers, real
   emails, live webhook URLs, real review links tied to a customer, or any
   customer/project identifiers.
3. Replace any real values with the placeholders documented in ../.env.example.
4. Re-import the sanitized file into a clean n8n instance to confirm it loads.
